<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DuPont lowered by Schroder.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DuPont lowered by Schroder.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co said on Monday it lowered its rating on the shares of DuPont Co to perform-in-line from an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- DuPont stock was up 1-3/8 at 60-1/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859=1730))</p>
</text>
